  <data name="richTextBoxEdit1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>COLLEGE APPLICATION TERMS AND CONDITIONS

By submitting this college application form, the applicant agrees to the following terms and conditions:

Accuracy of Information
The applicant certifies that all information provided in this application is true, complete, and accurate to the best of their knowledge. Any false or misleading information may result in the rejection of the application or cancellation of admission.
Submission of Required Documents
The applicant agrees to submit all required documents, including identification, academic records, and other supporting materials requested by the institution. Failure to provide complete requirements may delay or invalidate the application.
Review and Verification
The college reserves the right to verify any information provided by the applicant. This may include contacting previous schools, references, or other relevant institutions.
Admission Decision
Submission of this application does not guarantee admission. The college reserves the right to accept or reject applications based on its admission policies and evaluation procedures.
Data Privacy and Use of Information
The applicant consents to the collection, processing, and storage of their personal information for purposes related to admission, enrollment, academic records, and institutional reporting.
Compliance with College Policies
If admitted, the applicant agrees to comply with all policies, rules, and regulations of the college, including academic and disciplinary standards.
Application Processing
The college reserves the right to modify application procedures, deadlines, and requirements when necessary.
Agreement
By submitting this application, the applicant confirms that they have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms and Conditions. Click to confirm.</value>
